  named test (113 of the verifier round and the 12 of P8b). P8b copies only the files that the
  manifest lists.

After the signature (P8e-wasm, not signed).
- P3 crate, test and tool only: tests/slot_order.rs has one more test,
  a_real_output_in_the_last_slot_after_dummies_is_refused, and tools/mutate.py one more case,
  dummies-last-skips-last-slot. This is the gap that p3delta-verdict.json names (its own mutant
  own-dl-skip-last-slot survived every test of the crate). No file below src/ of the checker
  changed, so the rules and the checker wasm of the P3 crate (597,931 bytes) are those that the
  verdict signed. The manifest of the P3 crate is now 6cf7a152116db5f774213ba5dfc6a3647769b1bb1e45fcf3a5bee767857817f4
  The copy of tests/slot_order.rs in this crate is the new file. The case is killed by its test
  (mutation run in a copy without real_data.rs: 272 tests, clippy and fmt clean).
- wasm-sol only, outside the checker gate (the files marked `new` below, and wasm.rs): the
  checker entry points `check_message` and `rule_list` of wasm.rs are unchanged. src/frost.rs: the
  round 3 of the second DKG computes the echo from the round-1 documents, refuses a saved echo or
  a peer echo that differs, takes the commitments from the documents, and `share_fits` and
  `PROGRAM_LABEL` are new. src/codec.rs: one JSON reader that refuses a key written twice, at any
  depth, used by every seat map and typed read. src/sign.rs: `verify_strict` is a function of its
  own, which `aggregate` calls. src/wasm.rs: the exports sol_share_fits and sol_program_label, and
  a new argument list of sol_dkg3. These changes have tests and mutation cases (tools/mutate_sol.py)
  and no verifier has signed them. They do not weaken a rule of the checker: `approve` and every
  rule file are byte for byte the signed files.

Not copied from the P3 tests: real_data.rs and repo_vectors.rs (they read the solSeed file of
the P5 run, a secret). tests/common/real.rs is cut to address_of, the one helper that other tests
use; the code that read the solSeed file is removed. Vectors: only the public ones.
Copied from the P1 crate: tests/data (the RFC 9591 E.1 inputs and the vectors of frost-ed25519).

